# Build output and caches: the image builds them itself, and copying a host build in would
# quietly ship whatever happened to be on the machine that ran `docker compose up`.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.gradle
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/test-results
**/__pycache__

# Not part of any build
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
*.md
